0051   0000           00026 loop1   NOP                     ; Pad for 4 cycle loop
Message[305]: Using default destination of 1 (file).
0052   0BF0           00027                 DECFSZ  Timer1          ; Count
0053   2851           00028                 GOTO    loop1           ; until Z
0054   0008           00029                 RETURN                  ; and finish
                      00030 
                      00031 ;--------------------------------------------------------------
